{"repositoryId":1300523781,"availability":"available","full":"Manav0559/multi-asset-backtester","name":"multi-asset-backtester","description":"Multi-asset backtesting + multiplayer paper trading with honest statistics: Deflated Sharpe against counted trials, purged walk-forward CV, cost models, AST-sandboxed user strategies, margin & shorting on a row-locked ledger. FastAPI · Postgres · Next.js · CI · live demo · $0/month single-process deploy.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-14T13:28:54Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:36:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://multi-asset-backtester.vercel.app","topics":["algorithmic-trading","backtesting","fastapi","nextjs","paper-trading","postgresql","python","quantitative-finance"],"demo":"https://multi-asset-backtester.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.763Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.763Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.763Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.763Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🔴 Live demo: multi-asset-backtester.vercel.app (API: backtester-x37r.onrender.com; the free-tier backend sleeps when idle, so the first request can take 30–60s to wake.)","I wanted to test volatility and momentum ideas properly, and kept running into the same two walls: real backtesting infrastructure (point-in-time data, honest statistics, execution costs) is priced for institutions, and every \"learn to trade\" site hands you a backtester that quietly lies — lookahead in the features, cherry-picked Sharpe ratios, fills at prices nobody gets. So I built the thing I wanted to use: a platform where the statistics are honest by construction (Deflated Sharpe, purged walk-forward CV, shift(1) everywhere), where my friends and I can trade the same shared portfolio and…","Write strategies (or bring your own Python), backtest them on real historical prices with honest statistics, paper-trade live-ish prices inside shared portfolios with margin and shorting, and run consent-based head-to-head competitions."],"features":["1 · TradingView-grade indicator engine. One IndicatorService (pandas-ta, 151 indicators) serves the charting API, the built-in strategies, and the user sandbox — so a chart overlay and a backtest of the same indicator…","2 · Strategy registry on one contract. Every algorithm — legacy factories, class-based classics (Donchian breakout, Bollinger reversion, MACD trend, z-score pairs trading), ML, user code — implements the same…","3 · Bring-your-own-code sandbox. Users submit a Python class (setup() / next(i, bar) / vectorized generate(), plus self.indicator(\"rsi\", length=14)); an AST allowlist rejects imports, dunder access, and exec/eval with…","4 · ML. Seven model families (logistic → XGBoost) behind one leakage-hardened pipeline: purged + embargoed walk-forward CV (purge ≥ label horizon), isotonic calibration fit inside the training fold, a logistic baseline…","5 · Margin, shorting, and frictions. Shared portfolios support 2× leverage and short selling with Reg-T-style 150% initial margin, enforced under the same row lock that serializes the shared ledger. Fills pay…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Manav0559/multi-asset-backtester/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"53ae1619396521e83745bb171d5c3089d072c8d59e3e6e6f1ac0229862dd70ea","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.857Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.857Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🔴 Live demo: multi-asset-backtester.vercel.app (API: backtester-x37r.onrender.com; the free-tier backend sleeps when idle, so the first request can take 30–60s to wake.)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Manav0559/multi-asset-backtester/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Fills pay configurable slippage on both sides; backtests charge commission, slippage, and optional square-root market impact on turnover.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Manav0559/multi-asset-backtester/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"53ae1619396521e83745bb171d5c3089d072c8d59e3e6e6f1ac0229862dd70ea","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Manav0559/multi-asset-backtester/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.857Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T05:36:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Manav0559/multi-asset-backtester/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.858Z","hash":"53ae1619396521e83745bb171d5c3089d072c8d59e3e6e6f1ac0229862dd70ea","originalBytes":15008,"storedBytes":15008,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["screenshots","portfolios","real","backend","every","get","live","auth","backtests","database","indicator","one","portfolio","post","same","strategies","strategy","api","assets","backtest","backtesting","byoc","check","code","free-tier","head-to-head","honest","indicators","per","price","prices","runs","shared","sharpe","statistics","trade","trading","user","where","asset","backtester","backtester-x37r.onrender.com","between","bps","built","buying-power","chart","chat","competition","consent-based","constraint","curve","default","deflated","demo","deployment","env","equity","everything","fastapi","fills","first","history","honesty","idle","inside","jwt","ledger","limit","limiter","lookahead","macd","margin","market","multi-asset-backtester.vercel.app","never","open","orders","out","overlay","positions","postgres","process","python","rate","refresh","registry","request","results","running","sandbox","test","trades","two","wanted","when","yearly","about","abuse","access","accidents","active","actual","after","against","algorithm","allowlist","approximation","argue","ast","attempt","availability","avatars","background","backstop","bar","bars","basestrategy","batched","because","binance","bollinger","book","book.","breakout","breaks","bring","built-in"